### Generate 10 Motherboard parts

### 1. Add Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra Motherboard (Phone)
POST {{host}}{{part_mapping}}/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

21500.00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="quantity"

5
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra Mainboard 12GB/512GB
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="specifications"

Snapdragon 8 Gen 2, 12GB RAM, 512GB UFS 4.0 Storage, Unlocked
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="manufacturerId"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceTypeId"

3
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="partTypeId"

5
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceModels"

SM-S918B
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="partImage"; filename="motherboard01.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./assets/part_image/motherboard01.jpg

--WebAppBoundary--

